msgid "Not enough payouts in this year to measure a rate."
msgstr "Zu wenige Auszahlungen in diesem Jahr, um einen Satz zu messen."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-changes.html:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The corporation wallet only shows the corporation's own cut, so the ingame\n"
"                rate is not in it directly. It is recovered from the kills "
"behind each bounty: what the\n"
"                NPCs were worth against what arrived. Every move of that "
"share by at least\n"
"                %(minimum)s percentage points is listed, as long as the new "
"level held for two\n"
"                days - a corporation that switched three times appears three "
"times. The minimum\n"
"                is set on the settings page."
msgstr ""
"Das Corp-Wallet zeigt nur den Anteil der Corporation, der ingame rate steht "
"also nicht darin. Er wird aus den Kills hinter jeder bounty zurückgerechnet: "
"was die NPCs wert waren gegen das, was ankam. Jede Verschiebung dieses "
"Anteils um mindestens %(minimum)s Prozentpunkte wird aufgeführt, sofern die "
"neue Ebene zwei Tage hielt — eine Corporation, die dreimal gewechselt hat, "
"erscheint dreimal. Der Mindestwert steht in den Einstellungen."

